<p>Teleports you randomly within a large range (<acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">110, 125, 150, 175, 200</acronym>).</p><p>At level 4, it allows you to specify which creature to teleport.</p><p>At level 5, it allows you to choose the target area (radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20, 18, 16, 15, 14</acronym>).</p><p>If the target area is not in line of sight, there is a chance the spell will partially fail and teleport the target randomly.</p><p>Random teleports have a minimum range of 15.</p><p>The range will increase with your Spellpower.</p>